{"id":1554,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p>金秋送爽启新篇，逐梦前行赴新程。2026年9月11日至13日，中北大学机械工程学院2026级迎新工作圆满落幕。来自全国各地的787名本科生、189名研究生，共计976名新生齐聚中北、逐梦机械，在二龙山脚下开启崭新的求学征程。</p><p>谋定在先，以“机械精度”部署迎新工作</p><p>学院高度重视本次迎新工作，提前谋划、精细部署，9月7日到10日分不同层面召开三次迎新工作协调布置会，细化工作方案，明确分工、压实责任，确保各环节衔接顺畅、责任到人。在行知广场设置迎新点，组建由辅导员、学生党员、学生骨干、志愿者组成的迎新队伍，搭建报到服务点，简化报到流程。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ioll5ZUzNiUzAVUC4MfU8LZM774oz9QZozNan7CiMzNPnRC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZLYhRoShRUz67L8lDo77iMRT7U4rVnmQkLl-8oRLiMmTFLRA7MzTfLNMFLmvsnllJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F83C9CA7D3E68A549DC5EF6B1B483569/08D59A2C/277EE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 392px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IU8Q57MmWkL4-8UClWkMmA7MzGZnm9QbMR9YUl7soz9YozL0gihFp2hmCIa0LShVM1hVLYh7oRVRLNC4M87bo7UYU4lPLmCio7WVL4vZnlMFnmLDoR-bnzVFo7Q2nm7JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMml5bMRLYUz62nC7QkoR9bnN-anmCQ4LNWkUNlYLzTVUzN0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLkhVLSy4nNM7ozWkolWRUm9iMRnfL8CYM4NPLzMRolQFLNUaUmW7oR6FLmLPnm7JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC0E13FCD92B9BCB8544A3F279113C9F/2D0B2D87/231F1\" vheight=\" 274px\" vwidth=\" 389px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMml5bMRLYUz62nC7QkoR9bnN-anmCQ4LNWkUNlYLzTVUzN0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRLkhVLSy4nNM7ozWkolWRUm9iMRnfL8CYM4NPLzMRolQFLNUaUmW7oR6FLmLPnm7JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>同时，学院对迎新现场、机械大楼及学生公寓进行整体氛围布置，通过主题展板、迎新横幅、创意打卡点位等多元形式，营造浓厚热烈的迎新氛围，让新生入校即感受机械学院扎实的专业底蕴与暖心的人文温情。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Iozv5YUzCbLRvZMCz9PLlLsnmn2UzlQZM4-Zn7W2M7VVM770gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMkhRMky8UzrkUlnfL4WfL4QkUz7DLl74L4lPM7C8LmWFLRCYnNQfn7WFLmlZolLJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FB4C44A5BADA32A36BA161A33514F422/062FFADB/2589C\" vheight=\"255.60000610351562\" vwidth=\"454.3299865722656\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Iozv5YUzCbLRvZMCz9PLlLsnmn2UzlQZM4-Zn7W2M7VVM770gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkMkhRMky8UzrkUlnfL4WfL4QkUz7DLl74L4lPM7C8LmWFLRCYnNQfn7WFLmlZolLJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Inll5bUm7PL8Q7MCR9PUmGiUNrRMzUQ8ozLPUzWfLmfkM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfLYhfU1yYLR9ZMRGsozl8M7lsoRQ7nNV2Lm-4o7-ZUmrFU8UYUzGYoRnFLmWRMzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5A3AB20884079544E786DFAF2238B8B5/CD2A0284/22C55\" vheight=\"256.79998779296875\" vwidth=\"456.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Inll5bUm7PL8Q7MCR9PUmGiUNrRMzUQ8ozLPUzWfLmfkM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfLYhfU1yYLR9ZMRGsozl8M7lsoRQ7nNV2Lm-4o7-ZUmrFU8UYUzGYoRnFLmWRMzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>暖心护航，以“机械温度”迎接八方学子</p><p>本次集中迎新报到工作于9月11日下午至13日有序开展。报到现场秩序井然，工作人员与志愿者各司其职，认真完成现场秩序维持、材料核验、报到登记等工作。学院学生党员志愿服务队专项负责新生接驳引导，往返于报到点与学生宿舍，沿途讲解入学注意事项，助力新生快速熟悉校园环境、消除陌生感。各班兼职辅导员全程在岗，陪同新生熟悉教学区、食堂、公寓等生活学习区域，细致解答入学各类疑问，全方位保障新生顺利报到入住，扎实打通新生入校“最后一公里”。迎新期间，学院党委书记孙旭东、院长祝锡晶、党委副书记李晓杰、副院长苗鸿宾等班子领导亲临一线，慰问在岗工作人员与志愿者，询问新生报到进度，现场统筹调度各项工作，全力保障迎新服务高质高效开展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Inz95YL8rVLmAVoCRlPLzlbMR74L4vQbnRvPL4UbLmQ2L4G0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkLkyinSysLRM7olnRUm-sozCPnlM7nR-bM7-ZMzMVUzfFnm9YoRGPL8nFLzN4nRvJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FB05E703D9DCB27961ECDD294B853EA0/F828013D/193D7\" vheight=\"285.79998779296875\" vwidth=\"428.6000061035156\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Inz95YL8rVLmAVoCRlPLzlbMR74L4vQbnRvPL4UbLmQ2L4G0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkLkyinSysLRM7olnRUm-sozCPnlM7nR-bM7-ZMzMVUzfFnm9YoRGPL8nFLzN4nRvJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IUmf57n7nkMR-8nCRU4U87YU4NiL8CQPUzW7M7-anzT2Lmv0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4MShRUSh2UzNaLRCPMlrkLmL8UNLZLR78Ml7ioRQ2o7rFLlL8UlQkL7QFL4UPU4CJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/035CAFA900615EB234BC80145A586F8E/1C4AFB0F/341C6\" vheight=\"301.79998779296875\" vwidth=\"427.7300109863281\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IUmf57n7nkMR-8nCRU4U87YU4NiL8CQPUzW7M7-anzT2Lmv0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky4MShRUSh2UzNaLRCPMlrkLmL8UNLZLR78Ml7ioRQ2o7rFLlL8UlQkL7QFL4UPU4CJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ILzv5iU4lsoRMRMC77bUlLYLNC8nzMQ2U4-ZL4rVn7CYMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8LShRLkyYLlMVoR7YMz6fL4n2ol-sMNl4nRNZM4CYnzWFL7Qfnz9sM7VFL8-an7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D41C021CE81257A34F9B76E3D98762E2/0FAE874A/3B0DE\" vheight=\"328.79998779296875\" vwidth=\"438.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ILzv5iU4lsoRMRMC77bUlLYLNC8nzMQ2U4-ZL4rVn7CYMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8LShRLkyYLlMVoR7YMz6fL4n2ol-sMNl4nRNZM4CYnzWFL7Qfnz9sM7VFL8-an7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>家校同心，以“协同育人”凝聚共育合力</p><p>为搭建家校互通桥梁、深化协同育人成效，9月12日下午，学院在14号教学楼举办2026级新生家长见面会。学院党委副书记李晓杰、教学副院长苗鸿宾出席，2026级全体新生班主任、兼职辅导员参会。会上，苗鸿宾副院长围绕学院专业建设、培养方案、毕业与学位授予相关管理规定作详细介绍，重点解读家长关切的推免保研政策。李晓杰副书记从学院办学规模、师资力量、教学科研平台条件等方面展开介绍，结合优秀毕业生升学深造、学科竞赛、创新创业等真实典型案例，直观展示学院育人工作成效，并着重强调校园安全管理工作要求。整场见面会内容务实、解读精准，获得在场家长一致认可，大家对学子在机械学院的成长成才满怀信心与期待。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=In7l5DMzNiozCaoCz6fUz9PLmlsn7LQZMRMkMmrRLmviMRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysLShVMSy4MNCDoRQRLRGPoRL4LNlYLRNDozNPM4NZolQFMRNDL4Cbn7WFM47bMzGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/071E536F686C0018332E20969917989F/496369DB/71950\" vheight=\"276.3299865722656\" vwidth=\"415.0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=In7l5DMzNiozCaoCz6fUz9PLmlsn7LQZMRMkMmrRLmviMRU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkysLShVMSy4MNCDoRQRLRGPoRL4LNlYLRNDozNPM4NZolQFMRNDL4Cbn7WFM47bMzGJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ILlQ5VLm9snmVRLC4NDol7DM7UsoR6Q7ozGYM7VRLRMfo7C0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8LYyYnkyiLNUPM8-iMzlDMNr7MNLZU4-YolUsLl7DUz6FoRvZnm78U4TFL494oRvJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0432D52D17B55566ED6C8C229D71A6A7/878F14C9/38387\" vheight=\"281.7300109863281\" vwidth=\"422.7300109863281\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMmr5VM77anllDMC4Q2nl-anmCanR-QsnmNZn7-8U4UbLm70gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8U1yDMkh2nRUDnzUaUmVVol-4L87DLmTfUlVkUzGioRVFLznVL4r7UznFoR9ZM4LJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.png\"></p><p>深耕关怀，以“暖心走访”传递学院温情</p><p>9月13日下午，分管校领导杨风暴与全体院领导走进研究生新生宿舍，与研究生新生亲切交谈，细致询问住宿生活情况，了解新生学业规划与科研期许，勉励大家快速适应研究生节奏，潜心治学、深耕科研。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IL4754nNLaLRrfLCRf7LmUZL7lsnN-QZLlLZMzGZMmARo7C0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDokyaLYyYL4UiozLaMRV7MRfkM4NYL7liMNrfnzCbM4nFL7CinmC8olnFLzVVM4GJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/86803234593041D40B7920E56EAE6974/0F5F649D/11E70\" vheight=\"284.3999938964844\" vwidth=\"428.5299987792969\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IL4754nNLaLRrfLCRf7LmUZL7lsnN-QZLlLZMzGZMmARo7C0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDokyaLYyYL4UiozLaMRV7MRfkM4NYL7liMNrfnzCbM4nFL7CinmC8olnFLzVVM4GJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>随后，院领导带队，联合各系主任、副主任、专业负责人、新生班主任和辅导员，深入文瀛公寓本科新生宿舍，开展走访慰问。老师们与本科新生面对面谈心、零距离答疑，细致关切新生生活适配情况与大学发展规划，勉励全体新生珍惜韶华、笃实求学、勇敢逐梦，以全新姿态奔赴大学生活。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ioln5VMm62nRLiMCzUbMzCsoRM2L8CQaU4NZnNr7LRl4oR70gihFp2hmCIa0MYybU1yZLkybM4-8M4f2oR9DLm7PLzvDUz9YLl78UNCbnNVFLmvPMRL8MRfFLz7bMmGJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/79B80972470F886211176A821A4BF9FA/27143440/11960\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 431px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ioln5VMm62nRLiMCzUbMzCsoRM2L8CQaU4NZnNr7LRl4oR70gihFp2hmCIa0MYybU1yZLkybM4-8M4f2oR9DLm7PLzvDUz9YLl78UNCbnNVFLmvPMRL8MRfFLz7bMmGJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMRL5PU47bM8UZMCNn7M47YM7Q2nRrQRMRW2nmUZL87aUzN0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRnSyaLYyYLR9PnmN4MlrkUz9YnR98UzvPMllPM7VfolQFUNrVn7l4UzVFnzGDLkb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1CE032081F935EBA82D84A715E14AA9F/BEEDE3A1/E060\" vheight=\"287.3999938964844\" vwidth=\"431.0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMRL5PU47bM8UZMCNn7M47YM7Q2nRrQRMRW2nmUZL87aUzN0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRnSyaLYyYLR9PnmN4MlrkUz9YnR98UzvPMllPM7VfolQFUNrVn7l4UzVFnzGDLkb/v2rjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4UaoRlsgtA8pUqcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>逐梦新程，以“院训精神”照亮前行之路</p><p>初心育桃李，温情伴新程。本次迎新工作的圆满完成，为新生平稳过渡、安心入学筑牢坚实基础，以精细化、有温度的服务，充分彰显了机械工程学院深厚的人文底蕴与鲜明的育人特色。“博学厚德”锚定立德树人根本使命，“精机善械”彰显机械学科高精尖的卓越追求，激励学子深耕核心技术、锤炼集成能力、秉持匠心精神。愿2026级全体新生传承太行精神、牢记院训初心，以梦为马、不负韶华，在专业求索中精进本领，在知行实践中增长才干，乘风破浪、砥砺前行，奔赴属于自己的璀璨未来。</p><p><br></p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ioll5ZUzNiUzAVUC4MfU8LZM774oz9QZozNan7CiMzNPnRC0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZLYhRoShRUz67L8lDo77iMRT7U4rVnmQkLl-8oRLiMmTFLRA7MzTfLNMFLmvsnllJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky8LR9iMYbw62q8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=40857&e=.jpeg"}